    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="5.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 5.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif hwa his hyde forwyrce, ⁊ cyrican geierne, sy him sio swingelle forgifen.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If someone has committed an offense for which the penalty is whipping and he flees into a church, let him be spared the whipping</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If anyone renders himself liable to the lash and flees to the church, he shall be immune from scourging.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif hwa his hyde forwyrce ⁊ ciricean geirne, sy him seo swingele forgifen.</ab>
      </div>
